# text = he got a good estate by merchandise , and leaving off his trade , lived afterwards at york , from whence he had married my mother , whose relations were named robinson , a very good family in that country , and from whom i was called robinson kreutznaer ; but , by the usual corruption of words in england , we are now called — nay we call ourselves and write our name — crusoe ; and so my companions always called me .
